    "title": "Tyler Perry's 'Beauty in Black' Renewed for 3rd and Final Season at Netflix",
    "text": "The streamer also sets a March premiere date for Season 2, Part 2 December 11, 2025 @ 6:00 AM Taylor Polidore Williams as Kimmie in episode 212 of \"Beauty in Black\" (Credit: Quantrell Colbert/Netflix) Tyler Perry’s “Beauty in Black” has been picked up for its third and final season at Netflix. The renewal comes months ahead of the release of the series’ Season 2, Part 2 debut. “Beauty in Black” will pick back up on March 19 with eight more episodes to conclude the second season. Start for $1 – Select a Plan Annual (Most Popular) $3.83/week (billed annually) Monthly $6.25/week (billed monthly) Unlimited access to TheWrap Data insights & deep-dive features Exclusive videos & analysis Invite-only member events $1 for 14 days, then $4/week (billed annually at $199) or $6.25/week (billed every 4 weeks at $24.99). Plans renew automatically. Cancel anytime during your 14-day trial to avoid full-plan charges. Comments",
